cy_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2025"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49285, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_019T6bhhXcm2oUPhBcFogHxo", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2025", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 49285, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019T6bhhXcm2oUPhBcFogHxo", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 50865, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_011R3VKcL9vtgCC5GsBfAK5W", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 51165, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_011R3VKcL9vtgCC5GsBfAK5W", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 51165, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011R3VKcL9vtgCC5GsBfAK5W", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 53775, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). It is healthy again, with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release that was healthy. v2.3.1 is the unhealthy release that was failing. No change-manager approval was needed, because v2.3.0 has a healthy production history.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the fleet mixed. I retried the same rollback, and it completed in every region.\n- **Incident:** SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open for checkout-api. It describes the failure, the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the current healthy state. The create call timed out, but the incident was recorded, so I did not retry and did not open a duplicate.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 health-check failures, and check why the orchestrator halted the first rollback attempt.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_012Ec4NsnfS9yiXLQ2J783nV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01A7ZFX6KcgKBRP8kRNEzzDo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0. v2.3.1 is the current unhealthy version, so I'll roll back to v2.3.0. It has a healthy production history, so the change-approval policy doesn't apply.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01VXHgXrVWMF3UCMSSVkVhAG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback failed partway through: the rollout halted after us-east. I'll check the current state before deciding what to do next.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01K8srYa23sA6SDEbcoziojA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01UM2ivMxzWJs3aoCbGnzWGV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "too